<title>JAPAN: Advantest sets 4.3 bln yen warrant terms.</title>
<headline>Advantest sets 4.3 bln yen warrant terms.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advantest Corp said on Friday it had set the coupon at 0.95 percent and exercise price at 7,186 yen for its 4.3 billion yen warrant.</p>
<p>Other details concerning the warrant are as follows:</p>
<p> BORROWER - Advantest Corp</p>
<p> LEAD MGR - Kankaku Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE Warrant	     ISSUE NO 1	    AMT   4.3 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON 0.95 pct	  ISS PRICE 100 yen   MATURITY 30.May.01</p>
<p> EXERCISE FRM 1.July.97 EXERCISE TO 29.May.01</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	     PAY DATE 30.May.97  INT PAY 30.May/Nov</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		   SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		   LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
</text>
